    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fantasy Story Adventure</strong>: Immerse yourself in a cozy and enchanting tale filled with magic and mystery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Drawn Scenes</strong>: Each scene is meticulously illustrated and animated to create a unique isometric visual</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Interactive Levels</strong>: Interact with vibrant environments, click on every item and watch them animate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Companions</strong>: Collect and interact with up to five unique companions who offer special abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong>: Travel through various locations including a town, dungeon cave, and magic towers and forest river, each with its own set of challenges and hidden items to find.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702370/extras/04ed8f38bd77e6bd8762dd24cb7e9d76.avif?t=1729510939\" width=620 height=200 /></span>Step into a world of magic and mystery in &quot;&quot;Sword and Seek,&quot;&quot; a charming hand-drawn fantasy cozy hidden object game. Set in an era of peace, you play a humble adventurer eager to embark on your own journey. When an invitation from the kingdom arrives, inviting you to receive the blessing of the goddesses, you think, &quot;&quot;What can possibly go wrong?&quot;&quot;\u00a0<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702370/extras/b7d7cbd9e5d945802d316245ef14423c.poster.avif?t=1729510939\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702370/extras/b7d7cbd9e5d945802d316245ef14423c.webm?t=1729510939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702370/extras/b7d7cbd9e5d945802d316245ef14423c.mp4?t=1729510939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find quest items scattered throughout interactable hand-drawn scenes. As you journey through bustling villages, dungeons, and ancient ruins levels, find and collect quirky characters to help you along the way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek the truth behind the kingdom's invitation and start your own adventure in this fantasy tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Follow our Tiktok for <strong>Sword and Seek</strong> progress updates, first-looks, devlogs and cute little videos.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702370/extras/04ed8f38bd77e6bd8762dd24cb7e9d76.avif?t=1729510939\" width=620 height=200 /></span>Step into a world of magic and mystery in &quot;&quot;Sword and Seek,&quot;&quot; a charming hand-drawn fantasy cozy hidden object game. Set in an era of peace, you play a humble adventurer eager to embark on your own journey. When an invitation from the kingdom arrives, inviting you to receive the blessing of the goddesses, you think, &quot;&quot;What can possibly go wrong?&quot;&quot;\u00a0<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702370/extras/b7d7cbd9e5d945802d316245ef14423c.poster.avif?t=1729510939\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702370/extras/b7d7cbd9e5d945802d316245ef14423c.webm?t=1729510939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702370/extras/b7d7cbd9e5d945802d316245ef14423c.mp4?t=1729510939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find quest items scattered throughout interactable hand-drawn scenes. As you journey through bustling villages, dungeons, and ancient ruins levels, find and collect quirky characters to help you along the way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek the truth behind the kingdom's invitation and start your own adventure in this fantasy tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Follow our Tiktok for <strong>Sword and Seek</strong> progress updates, first-looks, devlogs and cute little videos.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
